---
import Illustration from './Illustration.astro';
---
<div class="coming-soon not-content">
  <div class="art"><Illustration name="robot" size={72} /></div>
  <div>
    <p class="title">준비 중이에요</p>
    <p class="desc">이 튜토리얼은 열심히 만들고 있어요. 공식 문서로 사실을 확인한 뒤 출처와 함께 공개할게요.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .coming-soon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    border: 2px dashed var(--ai-coral);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--ai-card-tint);
  }
  .title { margin: 0; font-size: var(--sl-text-h4); font-weight: 700; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .desc { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .coming-soon { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } }
</style>
